  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU for Freedom of Expression: Alignment of national media legislation with EU acquis and media standards</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The project is expected to enable legal environment that will promote freedom of expression, competitiveness and sustainability of media market, through the harmonisation of the media legislation with the Media Directive (EU)2018/1808. Specific objectives of the project are:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1. Harmonisation of the national legislation with Media Directive (EU)2018/1808, as well as other EU acquis and international standards, in view of changing market realities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;2. Enhancing capacities of national regulatory authorities and policy makers concerning provisions of Directive (EU) 2018/1808 and other relevant EU acquis.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
